    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Determines the axis to stick/trigger mapping for SDL 1.2.</para>
<para>Can be overwritten in two ways: Provide a &quot;SdlAxis Input::GetSdlAxis()&quot; in your input_buttons.cpp. While you are at it, add a proper mapping for the buttons in it Provide a EP_SDL_AXIS environment variable with comma seperated indices. Example: EP_SDL_AXIS=&quot;1,2,3,4,6,5,1,0&quot; (false = 0, true = 1) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
